    PACK --> GUIDE([Packing guide detail]):::pop
    PACK --> REJ([Reject plan]):::pop
    PACK --> PMAT[Packaging Materials]:::scr

  HOME -- Shipping Coordinator --> SHIP[Shipping & Fulfillment<br/><i>Ready to ship · Awaiting pickup<br/>In transit · Out for delivery<br/>Failed · Returning · Delivered<br/>Back at warehouse · Cancelled</i>]:::tab

